{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02779","headline":"同临津纪明府孤雁 · 卢照邻","name":"同临津纪明府孤雁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三秋违北地，万里向南翔。\n河洲花稍白，关塞叶初黄。\n避缴风霜劲，怀书道路长。\n水流疑箭动，月照似弓伤。\n横天无有阵，度海不成行。\n会刷能鸣羽，还赴上林乡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢照邻","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02779.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02779","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}